    /// This is the fixed-32-byte-key counterpart to the validated `SS16-8` walked shelf-transform path and intentionally keeps the mutation shape inside the concrete shelf family.<br/>
    /// The parent router route remains stable; only the walked full shelf offset is rewritten as a router and replacement shelves are appended.<br/>
